    "image": "hero-bg.png",
    "body": "<p class=\"lede\">The Internet and digital platforms have revolutionized the marketing industry. Digital marketing tactics have become indispensable in modern-day marketing plans, and to advance in these fields, opting for the best digital marketing institute in Kolkata is a good option. As the area keeps growing and evolving, it is crucial for marketers to be updated and aware of the newer trends. Here are the top 7 newest Digital Marketing trends that are going to make an impact in 2024:</p>\n\n<h2>1. Artificial Intelligence (AI) and Machine Learning (ML)</h2>\n\n<p>Digital marketing has been embracing artificial intelligence and machine learning. In 2024, it is expected that AI and ML will revolutionize digital marketing. AI-driven chatbots are used to deliver customer service and enhance website user experience. Machine learning algorithms are being used to properly analyze massive volumes of data, enabling marketers to more successfully target their audience. One should opt for the best digital marketing certification courses in Kolkata to learn how to use AI and ML appropriately.</p>\n\n<h2>2. Voice Search Optimization</h2>\n\n<p>Voice search is becoming increasingly common due to the increase in demand for virtual assistants like Siri, Alexa, and Google Assistant. Businesses will need to prioritize voice search optimization in 2024 if they want to guarantee that voice commands can find their websites. Marketers must concentrate on long-tail keywords and conversational language to make their content more voice search-friendly.</p>\n\n<h2>3. Video Marketing</h2>\n\n<p>Since its inception, video marketing has been the most popular form of content consumption &amp; will continue to be so in 2024. Video advertising is an essential component of a digital marketing strategy because of the success of sites like YouTube and Tiktok. Marketers may use videos to deliver compelling tales and simplify difficult concepts. A low-cost method of establishing credibility and trust is through video marketing.</p>\n\n<h2>4. Influencer Marketing</h2>\n\n<p>Influencer marketing has been enormously popular in recent years, and in 2024, its expansion is anticipated to continue. Influencers, who have a sizable social media following, may aid businesses in more successfully contacting their target market. For engagement and conversions, it is crucial for marketers first to pinpoint the influencers that best represent their brand values.</p>\n\n<h2>5. Personalization</h2>\n\n<p>Personalization has become a crucial component of digital marketing, and in 2024, its significance will grow. Businesses may learn useful information about their clients and provide individualized experiences thanks to technology and data analysis advances. To increase consumer happiness and loyalty, marketers should work to generate personalized content, suggest pertinent items, and provide individualized suggestions.</p>\n\n<h2>6. Augmented Reality (AR) &amp; Virtual Reality (VR)</h2>\n\n<p>Virtual reality (VR) and augmented reality (AR) will all likely become major digital marketing players by 2025. Marketers may use AR to give customers engaging experiences. Customers may virtually \"walk-through\" retail environments to browse items or experience services thanks to virtual reality (VR). By providing a more immersive experience, AR and VR can encourage customers to make purchases.</p>\n\n<h2>7. Chatbots</h2>\n\n<p>Chatbots have been one of the most well-known digital marketing developments recently. Companies all across the world have started using chatbots for a variety of purposes, including lead generation and customer service. With better conversational skills and machine learning technologies, chatbots will grow smarter. Chatbots will be essential for effective and dependable customer service in 2024.</p>\n\n<h2>Why Choose ASMI B-School?</h2>\n\n<p>If you want to stay ahead of the curve and enhance your skills in Digital Marketing, taking up a course at ASMI B-School, the best digital marketing institute in Kolkata, can help you achieve that goal. We offer comprehensive courses covering various digital marketing aspects and provide hands-on training with real-world projects. We also have experienced faculty with industry expertise and provide placement assistance and internship opportunities.</p>\n\n<p>For digital marketers to be successful, the latest developments in the field must be followed. Marketers should prepare for inventive developments in 2024 in artificial intelligence (AI), machine learning, voice search, video marketing, influencer marketing, customization, augmented reality (AR), virtual reality (VR), chatbots, and interactive content. The best digital marketing courses in Kolkata can help you develop the knowledge and abilities you need to remain on top of trends. In 2024, embrace these trends, keep up with the times, and maximize your use of digital marketing.</p>"
